/// An application that keeps its manifest and asks it in main:args: for a
/// range two versions match: the manifest takes the higher one and records
/// the request, and the host warns of it after main:args: ends, as it warns
/// of one the assembly made (docs/design/modules.md, decision 4).
class App packageUsing: manifest = Object new (
  |
    private modules = manifest.
  |
) (
  public main: platform args: arguments = (
    platform transcript
        show: (modules at: 'com.acme.util.Util' version: '2') new answer;
        newLine.
  )
)
